<title>ITALY: Italmobiliare sees 1997 flat or bit better.</title>
<headline>Italmobiliare sees 1997 flat or bit better.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment holding group Italmobiliare expects 1997 results &quot;equal to 1996 or slightly better&quot; thanks to the performance of its Italcementi unit, CEO Giampiero Pesente told the annual meeting.</p>
<p>Italmobiliare posted 1996 consolidated net attributable profit of 39.7 billion lire after 1995's 34.2 billion.</p>
<p>At 1412 GMT, Italmobiliare stock was 0.74 percent easier at 24,700 lire on a Milan bourse down over one percent.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsrom +392 66129589</p>
